---
description: App Factory project registration and quality rules
globs:
alwaysApply: true
---

Before editing this repository, read:

- `.factory/project-context.json`
- `.factory/standard-lock.json`
- `.factory/AGENTS.factory.md`
- `quality/quality-manifest.json`
- relevant project docs and feature contracts

The `projectType` field is authoritative. Do not re-scaffold an existing project. Do not use undisclosed fake production data, disconnected controls, or unverified completion claims. Report checks run and checks not run. `code_complete` is not `done`.
